        {
          "text": " Kigararaasi ikerubin abebenokakec kuiu, korapito eicoloŋ-lokaitim kabebenokakee, kiteos ireetakec, kosesenete ireeta luka ikerubin oicolon-Iokaitim,",
          "type": "text",
